 control the pace of battle to defeat your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from three classic RPG paths\u2014Warrior, Mage, or Taoist\u2014and unlock powerful skills as you level up. Collect gear, enhance your deck, and build your own combat style to take on tougher challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game keeps the satisfying sense of progression found in classic MMOs but removes the downsides:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No pay-to-win</strong> \u2014 everything can be earned through play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No boss stealing</strong> \u2014 all rewards belong to you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No hostile player killing</strong> \u2014 enjoy a safe and uninterrupted adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through diverse stages, face formidable bosses, and experience a full progression system\u2014all in a single-player environment without the grind of online games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a lighthearted and offbeat fantasy adventure, where the growth of your deck and character determines how far you can go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087980/extras/812a346f947c12dca79c0789f8a9f217.avif?t=1760544827\" width=1170 height=642 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087980/extras/02ff570703bcabe8cd3185f2c04091ba.poster.avif?t=1760544827\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087980/extras/02ff570703bcabe8cd3185f2c04091ba.webm?t=1760544827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087980/extras/02ff570703bcabe8cd3185f